  <!-- ===================== The round's moods ===================== -->

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Rimfolk_Thought_FairVote</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilMemory</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>5</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>1</stackLimit>
    <stages><li><label>the radio called our vote fair</label><description>A clerk of the Last Republic watched our vote and the count, and the Republic's evening broadcast said it was a fair one.</description><baseMoodEffect>3</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Rimfolk_Thought_InTheRegister</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilMemory</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>15</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>1</stackLimit>
    <stages><li><label>in the Republic's register</label><description>The Last Republic entered our election in its register, with my name and my seat on the council.</description><baseMoodEffect>3</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Rimfolk_Thought_RepublicMedal</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilMemory</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>60</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>1</stackLimit>
    <stages><li><label>the Republic's medal</label><description>A clerk of the Last Republic read a citation for what I did in the fight and pinned the Republic's medal on me.</description><baseMoodEffect>6</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Rimfolk_Thought_HeardCitation</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilMemory</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>3</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>1</stackLimit>
    <stages><li><label>heard a citation read</label><description>I stood at the gate while the Republic's clerk read a citation for one of us and pinned a medal on them.</description><baseMoodEffect>2</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Rimfolk_Thought_ShipLogged</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilMemory</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>10</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>1</stackLimit>
    <stages><li><label>the Fleet logged our ship</label><description>Officers of the Hollow Fleet walked our gravship with me and wrote it into their log, as they do with every ship they know.</description><baseMoodEffect>4</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Rimfolk_Thought_GaveTheOrder</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilMemory</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>60</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>1</stackLimit>
    <stages><li><label>gave the order to disembark</label><description>I went to the Hollow Fleet's hull and gave the order their captain never gave. The crew came down from their posts after two hundred years.</description><baseMoodEffect>8</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

</Defs>
